=== Tools ===
  Delete          [controlled]  Delete a workspace file
  Glob            [controlled]  Find paths by filename substring
  Grep            [controlled]  Search bounded text files
  Read            [controlled]  Read bounded workspace file
  Shell           [controlled]  Run command with workspace as cwd
  StrReplace      [controlled]  Replace exact unique text in a file
  Write           [controlled]  Write/overwrite a workspace file
  createDirectory [controlled]  Create directory inside workspace
  createFile      [controlled]  Create a new file without overwriting
  deleteFile      [controlled]  Delete a workspace file
  editFiles       [controlled]  Replace exact unique text in a file
  fileSearch      [controlled]  Find paths by filename substring
  listDirectory   [controlled]  List workspace directory
  readFile        [controlled]  Read bounded workspace file
  runInTerminal   [controlled]  Run command with workspace as cwd
  textSearch      [controlled]  Search bounded text files
  writeFile       [controlled]  Write/overwrite a workspace file

Authority: controlled
